Baseline: nkilib gdn_cte b32 s2304 d128 NEFF, verifier and profiler

kernel.neff is the compiled NEFF of nkilib.experimental.gdn.gdn_cte for
batch 32, seq_len 2304, head_dim 128, bfloat16, LNC=1, one rank: the slowest
case in the GDN benchmark at total_exec_time 14.779 ms.

The loop edits kernel.neff only. tools/verify.py runs it on the device against
a torch golden (max_abs_err <= 8e-4 per output), tools/single_core.py keeps it
LNC=1 and single-rank, tools/profile.py reports total_exec_time.

