Restore iter-1's 1392 Pool-hosted DGE slots to Activation (Pool0.bin back to baseline, S[72] renumbered 1..1392) and keep the other 1392 on SP: Pool is the worst DGE host (slowest queue start latency and its in-order stream carries the spill chain that gates PE), so the Activation+SP split beats both all-Activation (14779) and Pool+SP (14771) at 14501 us, -1.88%, bit-exact.

